The browser-extension source gained **voice commands**, segment-level **partial
transcripts**, and a **personal vocabulary** that feeds the deterministic cleanup
rules. Language selection and microphone error guidance were added, and a
transcript-field mismatch was fixed. These are source changes; this entry does
not establish a browser-store release or tested desktop/phone parity.

The earlier paired light/dark images showed an old marketing landing, not the
extension or a recorded dictation. That landing visibly advertised an unconnected
waitlist and unimplemented pricing, so those images have been withdrawn from this
entry. Current product screenshots and narrated films remain to be captured and
verified before publication.
